{"id":"649524","name":"玉米面馍馍","author":"丽彩（五谷杂粮）","authorId":"12357987","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/649524/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"300克"},{"name":"玉米面","amount":"200克"}],"sub":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"一个"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"50克"},{"name":"水","amount":"275克"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"5克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"粉类称重。","img":"images/649524/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入酵母，白糖。","img":"images/649524/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"一个鸡蛋。","img":"images/649524/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"还有275克水搅成絮状。","img":"images/649524/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"揉成面团，盖上保鲜膜发酵。","img":"images/649524/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"发酵至体积明显变大。","img":"images/649524/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"揉一揉，排气，搓成条切成适量的等份。","img":"images/649524/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"团成圆，搓出造型。","img":"images/649524/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"码入蒸锅，二次醒发十几二十分钟。","img":"images/649524/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"开火蒸十分钟，关火焖一会儿再取出。","img":"images/649524/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}